    {
      "id": "tN94KOmFBVGZNlrZ00JS0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1804.7108081339516,
      "y": 482.4968037190479,
      "width": 1940.7789306640625,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 817290030,
      "version": 1583,
      "versionNonce": 1054755442,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787343788413,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. If you join a game online, your computer opens the desktop app in Play Mode. Your desktop app connects to docker container in the cloud running Server Runner.\n\n2. If you edit a game, your computer opens the desktop app in Edit Mode. You can playtest a game, and the editor starts its own local Player Runner and Server Runner to simulate the game locally.\nThe AI can also run tests itself - it runs a Player and Server in the background too (in headless mode on a different port, so you don't see it).\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. If you join a game online, your computer opens the desktop app in Play Mode. Your desktop app connects to docker container in the cloud running Server Runner.\n\n2. If you edit a game, your computer opens the desktop app in Edit Mode. You can playtest a game, and the editor starts its own local Player Runner and Server Runner to simulate the game locally.\nThe AI can also run tests itself - it runs a Player and Server in the background too (in headless mode on a different port, so you don't see it).\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
